# Imaging and participant data must never enter this repository.
#
# This file is the first of two guards. It stops the accident. The second is
# .githooks/pre-commit, which stops the deliberate override, because
# `git add -f` ignores everything in here.
#
# PPMI Data Use Agreement v5.0 (April 2026) restricts redistribution of
# participant-level data. Git history is effectively permanent: a file
# committed and then deleted is still in the object store, still in every
# clone, and still in every fork. There is no clean undo.

# --- imaging formats ---------------------------------------------------------
*.dcm
*.DCM
*.ima
*.IMA
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.img
*.hdr
*.mhd
*.mha
*.raw
*.nrrd
*.nhdr
*.v
*.par
*.rec
*.analyze
*.minc
*.mnc

# --- archives, which hide the above -----------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar

# --- data directories --------------------------------------------------------
data/
Data/
DATA/
dicom/
DICOM/
raw/
ppmi/
PPMI/
naps/
NAPS/
dpuk/
DPUK/
cohorts/
participants/
derivatives/

# --- tabular participant data ------------------------------------------------
# PPMI ships clinical and binding-ratio tables as CSV. Keep every table
# outside the repository; the loaders take a path from config, never a
# committed file.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.sav
*.dta

# Explicit exceptions: small, synthetic, and checked by a human before being
# un-ignored. Add them one at a time with a reason, never with a wildcard.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic_*.csv

# --- model weights -----------------------------------------------------------
# A model trained on participant-level PPMI data may only be shared through
# routes MJFF approves. Code ships MIT; weights do not ship at all.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.pkl
*.joblib
checkpoints/
runs/
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/

# --- credentials -------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
loni_*.txt

# --- ordinary python ---------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- editor / os -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
